<title>FINLAND: MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES STEADY AT FIX.</title>
<headline>MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES STEADY AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Most Helibor interest rates were</p>
<p>unchanged at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The three-month rate rose one basis point to 3.10 percent.</p>
<p>			 February 5 fix	February 4 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor	  3.03 pct		3.01 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor	  3.06 pct		3.06 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor	  3.10 pct		3.09 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor	  3.20 pct		3.20 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor	  3.29 pct		3.29 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor	 3.38 pct		3.38 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 248</p>
</text>
